# Complex Template for SDK Deep Acceptance (AsterML v2)

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-template
schema: 1
title: Template Experiment
objective: Template instantiation deep acceptance
experimental_unit: well
factors:
  - name: treatment
    levels: [control, material]
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: g-control
schema: 1
name: Control
role: control
condition: untreated
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: g-material
schema: 1
name: Material
role: treatment
condition: 5% GelMA
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-gelma
schema: 1
name: GelMA
role: treatment
condition: 5% GelMA
concentration:
  value: 5
  unit: mg/mL
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: instrument_profile
id: uv-reader
schema: 1
class: plate_reader
model: Synergy H1
capabilities:
  - name: absorbance
    wavelength: 450 nm
source: built_in
```

```asterlab
kind: calculator
id: dil-stock
schema: 1
title: Stock Dilution
mode: dilution
stock:
  value: 20
  unit: mg/mL
target:
  value: 2
  unit: mg/mL
final_volume:
  value: 5
  unit: mL
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-cck8
schema: 1
title: CCK-8
endpoint: OD450
unit: AU
group_refs: [g-control, g-material]
timepoints: [D1]
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-seed
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: Seed cells
assay: assay-cck8
path: root/seed
timepoints: [D1]
uses:
  - ref: uv-reader
    role: instrument
  - ref: dil-stock
    role: calculator
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-read
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: Read OD450
assay: assay-cck8
path: root/read
timepoints: [D1]
uses:
  - ref: uv-reader
    role: instrument
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-template
schema: 1
steps: [step-seed, step-read]
edges:
  - from: step-seed
    to: step-read
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: plate-d1
schema: 1
format: 96
topology: plate
assay: assay-cck8
groups:
  g-control: [A1, A2, A3]
  g-material: [B1, B2, B3]
```

```asterlab
kind: sample
id: sample-1
schema: 1
sample_id: SAMPLE-001
group_ref: g-control
material_refs: [mat-gelma]
amount:
  value: 0.5
  unit: mL
```

```asterlab
kind: data_table
id: mp-od450
schema: 1
title: OD450 Readout
schema_id: cck8_od450
endpoint: OD450
columns:
  - key: well
    label: Well
    value_kind: text
  - key: od450
    label: OD450
    value_kind: number
    unit: AU
```
